@startuml Feature3_Seq_2
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 4: Offer Management - Sequence: Create Offer**

actor Recruiter
participant "Recruiter UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nOfferController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nOfferService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nApplicationRepository" as AppRepo
participant "<<repository>>\nOfferRepository" as Repo
participant "<<entity>>\nOfferDetail" as Entity
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB
participant "<<service>>\nMagicLinkService" as MagicLink

Recruiter -> UI: Submit offer details
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/offers
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: MakeOfferAsync(appId, dto)
activate Svc

Svc -> AppRepo: GetByIdAsync(appId)
activate AppRepo
AppRepo --> Svc: return Application
deactivate AppRepo

Svc -> Repo: InsertAsync(offerData)
activate Repo

Repo -> Entity: Create OfferDetail
activate Entity
Entity --> Repo: OfferDetail object
deactivate Entity

Repo -> DbContext: Add(entity) & SaveChangesAsync()
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: Execute SQL INSERT
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: return success
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: return success
deactivate DbContext

Repo --> Svc: return offerId
deactivate Repo

Svc -> MagicLink: IssueAsync(companyId, appId, "OFFER_RESPONSE")
activate MagicLink
note right of MagicLink: MagicLink Service internally\nsends the Offer Email
MagicLink --> Svc: return IssuedToken
deactivate MagicLink

Svc --> Ctrl: return MakeOfferResultDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON data
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Display success message
deactivate UI
@enduml
